{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "%lld hr": {
      "comment": "Label for duration in hours",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 小时"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 小時"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld min": {
      "comment": "Label for duration in minutes",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 分钟"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 分鐘"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Custom (minutes):": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加自定义（分钟）："
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加自訂（分鐘）："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a custom rest reminder interval.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加自定义休息提醒时长。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新增自訂休息提醒時長。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Basic Operations": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "基本操作"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "基本操作"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Break reminder is off": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "护眼提醒已关闭"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "護眼提醒已關閉"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click Reset to restore the built-in intervals and drop all custom ones.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击「重置」可恢复内置间隔，并清除所有自定义间隔。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "點擊「重設」可恢復內建間隔，並清除所有自訂間隔。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click Stop to end the reminder and clear the countdown.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击「停止」结束提醒并清除倒计时。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "點擊「停止」結束提醒並清除倒數計時。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click the delete button next to a custom interval to remove it. Built-in intervals cannot be deleted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击自定义间隔旁的删除按钮即可移除。内置间隔不可删除。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "點擊自訂間隔旁的刪除按鈕即可移除。內建間隔不可刪除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Custom Intervals": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自定义间隔"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自訂間隔"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Custom interval": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自定义时长"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自訂時長"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "删除"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "刪除"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter a positive number of minutes in the Add Custom field and click the add button, or press Return.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在「添加自定义(分钟)」输入框中填入大于 0 的分钟数，点击添加按钮或按回车键。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在「新增自訂(分鐘)」輸入框中填入大於 0 的分鐘數，點擊新增按鈕或按回車鍵。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eye Care": {
      "comment": "Name of the eye care reminder plugin",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "护眼"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "護眼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Figure 1: Status-bar popover layout": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "图 1：状态栏弹窗布局"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "圖 1：狀態列彈出視窗版面"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the notification permission is denied, the popover shows a warning with a button that opens System Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果通知权限被拒绝，弹窗会显示警告，并提供打开系统设置的按钮。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果通知權限被拒絕，彈出視窗會顯示警告，並提供開啟系統設定的按鈕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Interface": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "界面说明"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "介面說明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Interval": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提醒间隔"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提醒間隔"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Interval: a strip of interval buttons for choosing how often the reminder fires.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "间隔：一排间隔按钮，用于选择提醒的触发频率。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "間隔：一排間隔按鈕，用於選擇提醒的觸發頻率。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look away from the screen for 20 seconds to rest your eyes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "远离屏幕20秒，让眼睛休息一下。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "遠離螢幕20秒，讓眼睛休息一下。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Manage your custom reminder intervals. Click the delete button to remove custom intervals.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "管理您的自定义提醒时长。点击删除按钮可删除自定义时长。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "管理您的自訂提醒時長。點擊刪除按鈕可刪除自定義時長。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Next break: %lld mins": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下次休息：%lld 分钟"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下次休息：%lld 分鐘"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Next break: 1 min": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下次休息：1分钟"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下次休息：1分鐘"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Next break: less than 1 min": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下次休息：不到1分钟"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下次休息：不到1分鐘"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "注意事项"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "注意事項"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notification warning: appears when notifications are disabled, with a link to System Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通知警告：当通知权限被拒绝时显示，并提供跳转到系统设置的入口。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通知警告：當通知權限被拒絕時顯示，並提供跳轉到系統設定的入口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notifications Disabled": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通知已禁用"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通知已禁用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开设置"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開啟設定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Settings and go to the Eye Care page.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开设置，进入「护眼」页面。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開啟設定，進入「護眼」頁面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the menu-bar popover and click Start to begin the reminder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开菜单栏弹窗，点击「开始」开启提醒。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開啟選單列彈出視窗，點擊「開始」開啟提醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Overview": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "概述"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "概述"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick an interval under Interval to change how often the reminder fires; the change takes effect immediately.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在「间隔」区选择间隔以改变提醒频率，修改会立即生效。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在「間隔」區選擇間隔以改變提醒頻率，修改會立即生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Please enable notifications in System Settings to receive break reminders.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在系统设置中启用通知，以便接收休息提醒。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請在系統設定中啟用通知，以便接收休息提醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remind you to rest your eyes every 20 minutes": {
      "comment": "Description of what the Eye Care Reminder plugin does",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每20分钟提醒你休息眼睛"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每20分鐘提醒你休息眼睛"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reminder Behavior": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提醒行为"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提醒行為"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reminder Intervals": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提醒间隔"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提醒間隔"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Removing an interval that is currently selected falls back to the first built-in interval.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果删除的是当前选中的间隔，会自动回退到第一个内置间隔。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果刪除的是目前選中的間隔，會自動回退到第一個內建間隔。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reset": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重置"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重設"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reset to Default Intervals": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢复默认时长"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢復預設時長"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restore the built-in reminder intervals.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢复内置提醒时长。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢復內建提醒時長。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settings page: under Reminder Intervals, the built-in intervals, the add-custom field, and the reset button.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置页：在「提醒间隔」分组下，包含内置间隔、添加自定义间隔输入框和重置按钮。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "設定頁：在「提醒間隔」分組下，包含內建間隔、新增自訂間隔輸入框和重設按鈕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start": {
      "comment": "Button to start eye care reminder",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开始"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開始"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start / Stop: the control button in the popover header. It shows the next action, so it reads Stop while the reminder is running.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开始 / 停止：位于弹窗头部的控制按钮。它显示的是下一步可执行的动作，因此提醒运行中时显示「停止」。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開始 / 停止：位於彈出視窗頭部的控制按鈕。它顯示的是下一步可執行的動作，因此提醒執行中時顯示「停止」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Status": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "状态"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "狀態"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Status: the reminder state, the time until the next break, and today's break count.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "状态：提醒的运行状态、距离下次休息的剩余时间，以及今天的休息次数。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "狀態：提醒的執行狀態、距離下次休息的剩餘時間，以及今天的休息次數。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop": {
      "comment": "Button to stop eye care reminder",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "停止"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "停止"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The break counter resets each day and records how many breaks have been taken today.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "休息计数每天重置，记录当天已完成的休息次数。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "休息計數每天重置，記錄當天已完成的休息次數。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The break overlay is a non-interactive window; it does not block the mouse or the keyboard.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "休息浮层是一个不接收交互的窗口，不会阻塞鼠标与键盘操作。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "休息浮層是一個不接收互動的視窗，不會阻塞滑鼠與鍵盤操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The break overlay shows a hint to look away from the screen; it fades out automatically and needs no confirmation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "休息浮层会提示你把视线移开屏幕，它会自动淡出，无需手动确认。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "休息浮層會提示你把視線移開螢幕，它會自動淡出，無需手動確認。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The new interval appears in the list and is marked as a custom interval.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新间隔会出现在列表中，并标记为自定义间隔。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新間隔會出現在列表中，並標記為自訂間隔。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The reminder counts down continuously while it is running and shows the remaining time in the Status area.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提醒运行期间持续倒计时，剩余时间显示在「状态」区。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
